  tracked as separate routes\; the OpenReview demo and PhD symposium forms
  are set to close Nov 15\, 21:00 UTC. The Web4Good track is discontinued.
  Research must substantively address the Web\, not merely use a web datas
 et. Preserve WWW as the stable series alias. Size is an editorial estimat
 e.
CATEGORIES:Information Retrieval & Search,Recommender Systems,Graphs & Grap
 h Learning,LLM Agents & Tool Use
URL:https://www2027.thewebconf.org/
LOCATION:Dublin\, Ireland
END:VEVENT
